{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder instead of pca_n2000, maintaining singleprofile settings and no image modality. Validation accuracy improved to 0.5203 (from 0.4849) and F1 increased to 0.4982 (from 0.4639), suggesting the more complex encoder may enhance performance. However, the limited comparative evidence leaves uncertainty about whether this improvement is consistent across other configurations or datasets."
}

